{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step onto the beaches of Normandy and relive the turning point of World War II in a way never before possible \u2013 through Virtual Reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The D-Day VR Museum takes you on a compelling journey back to June 6, 1944, when Allied forces launched the largest amphibious assault in history. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One room / scene for each of the 5 beaches (Utah, Omaha, Gold, Juno, Sword)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One entrance room with an overview of the operation and the different locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >400+ exhibits, including 3D models, photos, and videos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ 3D scans of original equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional scenes with 360\u00b0 views for key locations such as (but not limited to) the Pegasus Bridge, the Beaches and the Normandy American Cemetery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive scene where you can jump out of an airplane over St Mere Eglise</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realism Redefined:</strong> Utilizing 3D scanned models and 360-degree imagery from the historic places of Normandy, the museum offers a visually stunning and authentic experience. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Historical Artifacts:</strong> Encounter a vast collection of authentic World War II artifacts, such as weapons, uniforms, vehicles, and personal items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Exhibits:</strong> Engage with interactive exhibits that provide in-depth information about the planning, execution, and aftermath of D-Day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relive History:</strong> Explore iconic locations of D-Day, witness key moments, and gain a profound appreciation for the sacrifices made by brave soldiers on that fateful day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Educational Experience:</strong> Immerse yourself in a blend of traditional museum exhibits and cutting-edge VR technology, providing an educational and emotionally impactful journey through history.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Echoes of Compassion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2512870/6db523584bc3b235acf8418face1b0442f098494.jpg"},{"name":"Armor of Valor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2512870/0dd704b6552f89316fe61d3271ba4d82b4de843d.jpg"},{"name":"Libert\u00e9","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2512870/de112d41a80adef3ac18b91e401991ce332934c1.jpg"},{"name":"A cigar and a Bowler Hat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2512870/5547a5a714e8bce3386c8155f8a178ad82380978.jpg"},{"name":"Against all odds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2512870/07d25c2c481401ae64d0d8b9265f905bc757a775.jpg"},{"name":"Courage and Conflict","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2512870/3521af6e22e5cab094133931839cede460bc3107.jpg"},{"name":"Behind Enemy Lines","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2512870/09c75b6647ed497f1995a816af556dacce991fe1.jpg"},{"name":"Air superiority","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2512870/067ed16df543c2d115564b44c5819df2e3a34d72.jpg"},{"name":"Trivia #1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2512870/08045dfada12ccb47054cdc90ac224b1de8c9a2e.jpg"},{"name":"Trivia #2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2512870/1b8412d26a2bb101a374b5436d0a90ac7b4cdfb5.jpg"}],"total":23},"background":"https://store.akamai.