eatures</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realism Redefined:</strong> Utilizing 3D scanned models and 360-degree imagery from the historic places of Normandy, the museum offers a visually stunning and authentic experience. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Historical Artifacts:</strong> Encounter a vast collection of authentic World War II artifacts, such as weapons, uniforms, vehicles, and personal items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Exhibits:</strong> Engage with interactive exhibits that provide in-depth information about the planning, execution, and aftermath of D-Day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relive History:</strong> Explore iconic locations of D-Day, witness key moments, and gain a profound appreciation for the sacrifices made by brave soldiers on that fateful day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Educational Experience:</strong> Immerse yourself in a blend of traditional museum exhibits and cutting-edge VR technology, providing an educational and emotionally impactful journey through history.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Lichtblau IT"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512870/beb9a1f472d112d7c251cfd7756aced863268436/header.jpg?t=1771321726","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce RTX 1070<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR / SteamVR</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2512870/1677802965/eadff3c1ce7729fe6c1ad53ab8ab785ae